The Smart AI Budget & Recommendation Assistant is an intelligent application designed to help users manage their personal finances effectively. The system analyzes the user's income, expenses, and spending patterns to create a suitable budget and provide personalized recommendations.

The assistant uses Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning techniques to categorize expenses, identify unnecessary spending, predict future expenses, and suggest ways to improve savings. Based on the user's financial information, it can recommend suitable spending limits for categories such as food, travel, education, shopping, and entertainment.

The system provides an easy-to-use interface where users can enter their income and daily expenses. It analyzes the collected data and generates a personalized budget plan. The assistant can also provide alerts when spending exceeds the recommended limit and offer suggestions to maintain better financial habits.

The main goal of this project is to make budget planning simple, intelligent, and personalized by using AI-based analysis and recommendations.
